WEBVTT

00:01.460 --> 00:03.670
Stop this nonsense and wake up, Hero!

00:03.670 --> 00:05.880
Come get your breakfast while it's hot.

00:09.920 --> 00:12.000
You are such an imbecile...

00:12.000 --> 00:13.380
C'mon, Max!

00:20.750 --> 00:21.790
Max...?

00:23.290 --> 00:24.830
Wait, is he even breathing?

00:24.830 --> 00:27.960
H-hey! Hang in there, Hero!

00:42.630 --> 00:43.710
<b>Level 1 Demon Lord and One Room Hero</b>

02:07.420 --> 02:13.540
<b>#2 Beware the Glasses Girl</b>

02:11.080 --> 02:13.540
You're leaving? Where are you going?

02:13.880 --> 02:14.960
Out.

02:14.960 --> 02:16.290
What's that supposed to mean?

02:16.290 --> 02:17.750
Fine, I'm going with you.

02:17.750 --> 02:21.000
'Scuse me? Like hell you are!
Yer a pain in the ass.

02:21.000 --> 02:22.920
How dare you speak to me like that?!

02:22.920 --> 02:25.580
What, are you embarrassed to be
seen with me or something?!

02:25.580 --> 02:27.880
Quit talkin' like yer my mother.

02:27.880 --> 02:30.210
I can't go walkin' around
in public with a demon.

02:30.210 --> 02:33.330
If yer gonna leave the apartment, do somethin'
about that third eye and those horns.

02:36.670 --> 02:37.960
Very suspicious...

02:37.960 --> 02:40.580
What does he normally do
during the day, anyway?

02:41.290 --> 02:46.290
Perhaps he's undergoing secret training of
some sort, in preparation for our rematch...

02:46.290 --> 02:48.380
I must confirm my suspicions...

02:48.380 --> 02:49.830
Oh, I know!

02:49.830 --> 02:52.040
I'll use my special transmog magic
to disguise myself!

02:52.420 --> 02:54.920
Shapeshifting is a demon lord's
area of expertise, after all!

02:56.710 --> 02:59.880
But what form shall I take this time...?

03:00.130 --> 03:01.380
Speaking of which...

03:01.380 --> 03:05.040
I believe my dearest Zenia called
this outfit a "school uniform."

03:05.040 --> 03:09.130
Then perhaps it would be wise to turn myself
into a student of the appropriate age.

03:09.460 --> 03:10.830
Metamorphose!

03:25.170 --> 03:27.000
There! Perfect!

03:29.290 --> 03:32.210
It seems my magic dissipates
whenever I lose focus.

03:32.210 --> 03:34.040
I must remain vigilant...

03:37.460 --> 03:39.460
Wow, look at all this...

03:39.460 --> 03:42.670
The Human Realm sure has changed
over the last ten years.

03:43.290 --> 03:45.130
They've built more tall buildings...

03:45.130 --> 03:45.830
Candy, candy! Now hiring!

03:45.830 --> 03:48.540
Candy, candy! Now hiring!
And they've really upped<b>
</b>their transportation game.<b></b>

03:46.210 --> 03:48.540
<b>High-paying Part-time Jobs</b>

03:46.210 --> 03:48.540
<b>I love money!</b>

03:46.210 --> 03:48.540
<b>High Income Employment Opportunities</b>

03:46.210 --> 03:48.540
<b>Right from your smartphone or PC</b>

03:48.670 --> 03:50.670
Hi there! How can I help you?
The human race never fails to<b>
</b>impress me with their ingenuity.<b></b>

03:50.670 --> 03:52.080
One kebab, please!
The human race never fails to<b>
</b>impress me with their ingenuity.<b></b>

03:52.080 --> 03:53.580
Check it out...

03:53.580 --> 03:54.830
Oh, my God...

03:54.830 --> 03:56.500
Is she serious...?

03:58.540 --> 04:00.960
<b>One-Room Video</b>

03:58.750 --> 04:00.580
What kind of shop is this...?

04:01.170 --> 04:04.830
Oh, I see. An establishment for
viewing films and the like.

04:04.830 --> 04:07.540
Though I don't know why you
wouldn't just watch it at home...

04:08.420 --> 04:10.040
Now then, Max...

04:10.040 --> 04:12.290
You shan't escape my eagle eyes.

04:12.290 --> 04:14.170
He's gotta be around here somewhere...

04:15.630 --> 04:16.710
Over there!

04:16.920 --> 04:19.000
Alright, commence stalking!

04:19.000 --> 04:21.920
You shall spill all your secrets, Hero!

04:28.420 --> 04:29.920
He went inside that shop...

04:33.710 --> 04:36.630
Well, that was fast. What did he buy...?

04:38.830 --> 04:40.250
Oh, he opened it.

04:48.080 --> 04:51.000
Yeah... I don't think he's secretly training...

05:02.630 --> 05:05.330
Is this really how he's going to
spend his entire day...?

05:05.330 --> 05:08.290
Look, there he is! Hiya, Mr. Hero!

05:08.290 --> 05:09.130
Huh?

05:09.130 --> 05:10.210
Hey, kid.

05:10.210 --> 05:11.500
Thank goodness!

05:11.500 --> 05:14.580
There are still people out there
who idolize Max as a hero!

05:14.750 --> 05:16.960
Let's play soccer, Mr. Hero!

05:16.960 --> 05:19.880
What, again? Sure, I guess.

05:19.880 --> 05:22.540
Day drinking again? Loser.

05:22.540 --> 05:26.250
You're a big guy, Mr. Hero,
so it's gonna be us three versus you!

05:26.250 --> 05:28.420
Fine by me. Bring it on!

05:31.170 --> 05:34.330
Aw, what's the matter?!
Try 'n' take it from me if ya can!

05:34.670 --> 05:37.630
No fair, Mr. Hero!
You're supposed to go easy on us!

05:37.630 --> 05:38.960
Eat this!

05:38.960 --> 05:40.330
Oh, now you've done it!

05:40.330 --> 05:43.130
Pesky little ankle-biter...!

05:45.040 --> 05:46.210
Ya listenin'?

05:46.210 --> 05:48.880
Ten years ago, I fought off
a whole swarm of demons.

05:48.880 --> 05:51.960
"Slash! Slice! Stab!" Like that!

05:51.960 --> 05:52.960
For real?!

05:53.330 --> 05:56.040
Honestly... even with a bunch of
literal children around,

05:56.040 --> 05:58.380
it feels like he fits right in...

05:58.380 --> 05:59.920
Yosuke, come here!

06:00.670 --> 06:02.250
Crap, it's my mom...

06:02.250 --> 06:05.540
Sorry, Mr. Hero. Sorry, guys. I gotta go...

06:05.540 --> 06:07.710
'Kay. Take care, kid.

06:07.710 --> 06:11.040
Uh, I should... probably head home, too.

06:11.040 --> 06:12.130
Yeah?

06:12.630 --> 06:16.960
The truth is, my mom says I'm not allowed
to play with you anymore, Mr. Hero...

06:16.960 --> 06:20.670
Ah. Well, you should always listen to yer mom.

06:22.540 --> 06:26.960
My parents don't care one way or the other,
so I'll come back and play when I feel like it.

06:26.960 --> 06:27.790
Here.

06:27.790 --> 06:29.130
Thank ya kindly.

06:29.330 --> 06:32.000
Later. I'll tell my mom you said hello.

06:32.000 --> 06:33.540
I'd rather ya didn't!

06:43.500 --> 06:45.880
Why didn't he just go back to the apartment...?

06:45.880 --> 06:47.250
Good grief...

06:47.250 --> 06:50.080
Maybe I oughtta head home
and start getting dinner ready...

06:50.080 --> 06:51.500
Yo, old-timer!

06:51.960 --> 06:55.420
Ya can't sleep on a park bench.
Yer gonna bother yer neighbors.

06:55.420 --> 06:56.790
Wake up, jerkwad!

06:58.040 --> 06:59.580
Don't gimme that!

06:59.580 --> 07:01.540
C'mon, ya bastard. I said stand up!

07:02.460 --> 07:04.290
Watch it, punk...

07:04.290 --> 07:06.290
Don't you know who I am?

07:06.290 --> 07:09.130
Who gives a shit?
Just some lazy bum, I bet.

07:09.130 --> 07:10.000
Amirite?

07:10.000 --> 07:13.920
I'm surprised the cops haven't
picked his sorry ass up already...

07:13.920 --> 07:16.710
How's about we give ya some
correctional treatment?!

07:20.380 --> 07:23.040
Go ahead, gimme yer best shot.

07:23.040 --> 07:24.330
What's the matter? Too scared?

07:28.130 --> 07:30.080
<b>Max the Hero Violently Attacks a Civilian?</b>

07:30.290 --> 07:32.630
D-don't do it, Max!

07:32.630 --> 07:34.040
Just let it go!

07:36.080 --> 07:39.080
You lousy little smartasses
ain't even worth my time.

07:39.080 --> 07:41.540
If ya feel better now, then go home, twerp.

07:43.880 --> 07:45.880
Ooh, I'm quakin' in my boots!

07:45.880 --> 07:47.290
Uh-oh!

07:47.290 --> 07:48.920
Fuck off, old man!

07:49.920 --> 07:54.710
Society would be so much better off
without pieces of shit like you livin' in it!

07:54.710 --> 07:56.210
Now apologize!

07:56.210 --> 07:58.330
Apologize to everyone, ya filth!

07:59.830 --> 08:01.460
Let's try this again!

08:08.170 --> 08:11.000
My hypnosis spell, "Sleep Mind."

08:11.750 --> 08:15.460
Fret not, Hero. Those miscreants
shan't lay a finger on you.

08:16.380 --> 08:19.460
If you saw it happening,
why didn't you help me sooner?

08:23.040 --> 08:24.250
Forgive me...

08:24.250 --> 08:27.460
It was not my intention to embarrass you.

08:27.750 --> 08:29.750
Eh, it's whatever.

08:29.750 --> 08:32.710
I'm sure you get what I meant now.

08:32.710 --> 08:35.000
I ain't no hero anymore.

08:35.380 --> 08:37.750
Guzzlin' booze in the middle of the day,

08:37.750 --> 08:40.460
paradin' around like a hotshot
for a buncha brats...

08:40.830 --> 08:45.330
Gettin' beat on by those pricks
and not bein' able to fight back...

08:45.330 --> 08:48.290
I was really freakin' out back there.

08:48.290 --> 08:49.960
God, I'm pathetic...

08:49.960 --> 08:51.380
That's not true!

08:51.380 --> 08:53.210
You were right not to hit them back!

08:53.210 --> 08:54.670
You're the bigger person!

08:55.330 --> 08:57.170
That's a little corny, don'tcha think?

08:57.500 --> 09:00.210
"If ya feel better now, then go home, twerp."

09:00.210 --> 09:02.040
C'mere, ya pipsqueak!

09:02.040 --> 09:02.750
Why, you...!

09:02.750 --> 09:03.830
I'm kidding! I thought you sounded cool!
Why, you...!<b></b>

09:03.830 --> 09:05.290
I'm kidding! I thought you sounded cool!

09:06.750 --> 09:11.000
Come on, let's go home and eat!
What should I make tonight?

09:12.710 --> 09:15.080
I need to make a quick stop first.

09:15.080 --> 09:16.960
I'll be home by dinner time.

09:16.960 --> 09:18.790
Huh? Where are you going?

09:18.790 --> 09:20.000
Out.

09:20.000 --> 09:21.580
Of course...

09:21.580 --> 09:23.710
He's a real piece of work, I swear...

09:24.040 --> 09:25.960
Whaddya want for dinner?!

09:25.960 --> 09:27.920
Uh, Hamburg steak.

09:32.290 --> 09:35.500
Garnish with potatoes, green beans, and...

09:35.790 --> 09:37.790
I hope we still have carrots.

09:39.420 --> 09:40.540
Oh, good.

09:41.080 --> 09:45.250
You know, I wonder what was so important that
that brainless Hero just HAD to go do...

09:45.250 --> 09:47.710
I'd like to believe he's not
out drinking again, but...

10:05.250 --> 10:11.000
<b>One-Room Viewings</b>

10:05.250 --> 10:11.000
<b>Comfortable Amenities</b>

10:05.250 --> 10:11.000
<b>(Check-in 2F)</b>

10:05.250 --> 10:11.000
<b>One-Room Video</b>

10:05.250 --> 10:11.000
<b>State-of-the-art</b>

10:05.250 --> 10:11.000
<b>VR 1000</b>

10:24.380 --> 10:26.080
<b>Land for Sale</b>

10:26.290 --> 10:28.080
What is with that woman?

10:28.080 --> 10:30.080
That's one hell of an outfit...

10:30.290 --> 10:31.500
I'm home!

10:32.330 --> 10:34.000
Wanna go ahead and eat now?

10:34.000 --> 10:35.540
Huh? Sure, but...

10:35.540 --> 10:38.580
I saw this woman walkin' around
in a crazy outfit just now...

10:38.580 --> 10:41.880
Really? I must've missed her
on my way back...

10:41.880 --> 10:44.790
It was INSANE!
She was practically naked!

10:46.040 --> 10:50.000
What happened to humans having morals
and a sense of decency, am I right?

10:50.290 --> 10:51.670
Okay, food's ready!

10:51.670 --> 10:53.130
Eat as much as you like!

10:53.500 --> 10:55.750
Hey! You could at least say thanks!

10:55.750 --> 10:57.790
Yeah, yeah... Thanks, I guess.

10:58.580 --> 10:59.790
A visitor?

11:00.250 --> 11:02.830
I'll be back in a minute.
Don't start without me.

11:02.830 --> 11:06.920
Ya don't gotta answer it!
It's probably just a salesman, anyway!

11:07.670 --> 11:09.290
Yes? How can I help you?

11:13.420 --> 11:16.250
Your Grace... You're alright...

11:16.460 --> 11:18.630
Zenia, what are you doing here?!

11:18.630 --> 11:20.580
Didn't I tell you to wait at the castle?!

11:20.580 --> 11:25.210
"I'll be back in no time, so be sure and have
my supper ready," is what you said...

11:42.580 --> 11:44.790
I see her appetite hasn't changed...

11:44.790 --> 11:47.790
And unfortunately for us,
our dinner's quickly disappearin'...

11:51.960 --> 11:53.540
An excellent meal, milord.

11:53.540 --> 11:56.670
Even your skills as a chef
befit a ruler of demonkind.

11:56.830 --> 11:58.330
She demolished that shit!

11:58.330 --> 12:01.830
Oh well. We can just go and buy
something else later.

12:02.290 --> 12:04.420
That really hit the spot...

12:04.420 --> 12:07.710
By the way, do you have
a toothpick or something?

12:07.710 --> 12:09.710
The hell's wrong with this woman?

12:09.710 --> 12:11.830
Please excuse her poor manners.

12:11.830 --> 12:13.710
Her name is Zenia.

12:13.710 --> 12:15.210
She's my personal secretary.

12:15.210 --> 12:17.210
A secretary?! HER?!

12:17.210 --> 12:19.210
Are you sure she's qualified for that?!

12:19.210 --> 12:20.790
How rude!

12:20.790 --> 12:23.540
I am His Grace's faithful servant!

12:23.790 --> 12:26.750
With naught but a firm devotion to
His Grace in my heart,

12:26.750 --> 12:32.080
I, Zenia, trudged across the land
for three days and three nights.

12:32.080 --> 12:33.630
Wait, you walked here...?

12:33.630 --> 12:38.290
She probably didn't think to use any of the
transit systems you humans have in place...

12:38.290 --> 12:40.500
'Twas a difficult journey...

12:40.500 --> 12:43.580
The humans would point at me
as they passed by,

12:43.580 --> 12:45.750
sneering or giving me disgusted looks...

12:45.750 --> 12:49.380
I suffered as a result of their
irrational prejudices against demons!

12:49.380 --> 12:52.670
Er... I think it has more to do
with your outfit...

12:52.670 --> 12:54.000
Come along, Your Grace!

12:54.000 --> 12:56.130
Please return to the castle at once!

12:56.130 --> 12:57.960
Where is this coming from...?

12:57.960 --> 13:00.130
The longer you associate with
this washed-up Hero,

13:00.130 --> 13:01.670
the more brain cells you'll lose!

13:01.670 --> 13:02.880
Stop it, Zenia!

13:02.880 --> 13:06.920
How dare you speak so disrespectfully after
barging in and helping yourself to our food?!

13:06.920 --> 13:11.580
Besides, the whole reason I'm staying here
is to experience human society for myself.

13:11.580 --> 13:14.210
It's my base of operations
for gathering intel!

13:14.210 --> 13:16.000
Don't be ridiculous, Your Grace!

13:16.000 --> 13:19.080
You're obsessed with this sleazeball,
if not downright in love with him!

13:19.080 --> 13:21.210
Sleazeball...? Sleazeball?
I see right through your façade!<b></b>

13:21.210 --> 13:23.130
Ya don't have to be gross about it!

13:23.670 --> 13:27.460
I thought you'd be back as soon as you
found out about the Hero's current situation,

13:27.460 --> 13:29.250
but I never imagined THIS...

13:29.250 --> 13:31.710
Take him if ya want. No skin off my nose.

13:31.710 --> 13:32.920
Excuse me?!

13:32.920 --> 13:34.880
You can't even FUNCTION without me!

13:34.880 --> 13:37.630
Your pitiful ass would DIE
if I left you here alone!

13:37.630 --> 13:40.040
Pretty sure I'd be fine, but okay...

13:40.040 --> 13:41.420
Alright then...

13:41.420 --> 13:42.630
Since it's come to this...

13:42.630 --> 13:46.830
I shall take it upon myself to sever
His Grace's ties with you, once and for all!

13:46.830 --> 13:49.080
Let's go, Hero! Prepare yourself!

13:49.080 --> 13:51.580
Brass knuckles?! Is she for real?!

13:51.580 --> 13:54.170
She just can't make my life easy, can she?

13:54.170 --> 13:58.000
I thought for sure she'd be the type
to use magic or somethin'...

13:58.000 --> 14:00.880
Zenia's aptitude for magic
is completely nonexistent.

14:00.880 --> 14:03.580
Wait, is THAT why she walked here...?!

14:03.580 --> 14:05.710
What are you whispering about over there?!

14:05.710 --> 14:07.830
If you won't come to me, then I'll go to you!

14:07.830 --> 14:09.920
Stop her, wouldja, Bossman?

14:09.920 --> 14:13.000
Enough, Zenia.
You don't stand a chance against him.

14:13.000 --> 14:14.250
No, don't-!
Wha-?!<b></b>

14:18.830 --> 14:21.210
Give it a rest, ya amateur.

14:21.210 --> 14:25.290
How many nobodies like you do ya think
I've put outta their misery over the years?

14:25.290 --> 14:26.540
Knock it off, Max!

14:26.540 --> 14:29.670
She's just a girl! There's no need
to rough her up like that!

14:29.670 --> 14:31.880
Yeah, whatever. My bad.

14:31.880 --> 14:33.960
You too, Zenia!

14:33.960 --> 14:37.170
Had Max not gone easy on you,
you wouldn't be alive right now!

14:37.170 --> 14:39.210
Go on. Let's hear an apology.

14:39.210 --> 14:41.130
I-I'm sorry...

14:41.130 --> 14:44.290
Wow, that's a surprise.
Awfully obedient, ain'tcha?

14:45.920 --> 14:50.040
Yes, well... I can see why His Grace
speaks highly of your strength.

14:50.040 --> 14:51.880
Enemy or not, it's admirable.

14:51.880 --> 14:53.540
See? That's what I'M saying!

14:53.540 --> 14:56.250
Where the hell do they get
that kind of confidence...?

14:57.580 --> 14:59.630
You're covered in sweat, Zenia.

14:59.630 --> 15:01.040
Y-yes...

15:01.040 --> 15:03.830
Like I said, it was a long journey...

15:03.830 --> 15:05.290
Why don't you go take a bath?

15:05.290 --> 15:07.130
Oh, are you sure? I'd love to...

15:07.130 --> 15:09.420
Try askin' the guy who owns the place!

15:12.130 --> 15:14.830
I apologize for my secretary's
atrocious behavior.

15:14.830 --> 15:16.960
Yeah, "atrocious" is right...

15:16.960 --> 15:19.040
She packs a crazy punch!

15:19.040 --> 15:22.130
I'd say she's thirty times stronger
than that punk at the park.

15:22.130 --> 15:23.380
Yeah...

15:23.380 --> 15:26.040
Anyone else would've been in real trouble.

15:26.500 --> 15:28.710
But it must be hard on you, too.

15:28.710 --> 15:30.710
Having HER for a secretary.

15:30.710 --> 15:32.080
Did no one else apply?

15:33.250 --> 15:36.710
Sure, Zenia's a little rough
around the edges...

15:36.710 --> 15:39.920
But when it comes to gathering intel,
she's an expert.

15:39.920 --> 15:43.830
She seemed to know all about your reputation
before I awoke from my slumber.

15:43.830 --> 15:45.130
Yeah...?

15:47.210 --> 15:48.540
Whoa, whoa, whoa!

15:48.790 --> 15:51.830
Thank you very much, Your Grace.
That bath felt fantastic.

15:51.830 --> 15:53.670
Good, I'm glad to hear it.

15:53.670 --> 15:55.380
Try thankin' ME!

15:55.380 --> 15:58.290
The place is a pigsty,
but make yourself at home.

15:58.290 --> 16:00.460
Help yourself to any of the drinks
in the fridge.

16:00.460 --> 16:02.750
I appreciate it, Your Grace.

16:03.210 --> 16:05.080
Fine, do whatever ya want...

16:05.080 --> 16:06.500
I'm starvin'...

16:06.500 --> 16:08.380
That's right, I forgot.

16:08.380 --> 16:10.460
Alright, I'll go and buy us some dinner.

16:10.460 --> 16:11.750
'Kay...

16:12.380 --> 16:13.210
What?!

16:13.210 --> 16:16.880
Remember, Zenia, you are
a guest in this house.

16:16.880 --> 16:18.710
Be nice to Max. Got it?

16:18.710 --> 16:20.330
Y-yes, milord...

16:20.330 --> 16:21.790
H-hey, wait a second!

16:21.790 --> 16:23.000
I'll be back soon!
Please, take me with you-!<b></b>

16:23.000 --> 16:23.580
Please, take me with you-!

16:24.170 --> 16:25.880
W-wait...

16:28.920 --> 16:29.710
Phew!

16:29.710 --> 16:30.500
Uh...
Phew!<b></b>

16:30.500 --> 16:31.330
Uh...

16:31.630 --> 16:35.580
I went and dug up some information on
your reprehensible dating history.

16:37.170 --> 16:41.420
You fooled around with woman after woman,
like a lecherous degenerate.

16:43.000 --> 16:44.380
Listen up, pal!

16:44.380 --> 16:47.670
If you corrupt His Grace with your
unsavory ways, I'll make you regret it!

16:47.670 --> 16:49.210
The hell are you talkin' about?

16:49.210 --> 16:50.830
Yer not makin' any sense!

16:50.830 --> 16:51.880
Phew!

16:51.880 --> 16:56.630
And just so you know, the fact that you
beat me like that earlier was a total fluke!

16:56.630 --> 16:57.880
Oh yeah?

16:57.880 --> 16:59.960
Yeah, 'cause if we hadn't been
in His Grace's presence,

16:59.960 --> 17:03.500
I would've ground your wimpy ass
into mincemeat with my fists!

17:03.500 --> 17:05.580
Sure, whatever you say...

17:05.830 --> 17:07.330
'Scuse me?!

17:07.330 --> 17:09.460
What's with the lousy attitude?!

17:09.460 --> 17:11.750
Pay attention when I'm talking to you!

17:11.750 --> 17:14.040
You're a pretty shitty hero, aren'tcha?!

17:14.040 --> 17:16.630
Whoa, what's the matter with you
all of a sudden?!

17:16.630 --> 17:18.420
Hey, get back here!

17:18.420 --> 17:20.500
Wait, is that booze?!

17:18.420 --> 17:23.080
<b>Contains Alcohol</b>

17:20.500 --> 17:23.080
If you can't handle ONE,
then you shouldn't drink at all!

17:23.210 --> 17:24.710
What...?

17:24.710 --> 17:26.330
No, no, no...!

17:26.330 --> 17:28.040
Quit that, you've had enough!

17:28.040 --> 17:30.420
Shuddup and leave me alone, ya stupid-

17:33.540 --> 17:35.670
I-I'm sorry! It was an accident, I swear!

17:35.670 --> 17:37.250
Don't sue me! Please!

17:37.250 --> 17:39.460
Uh, tea! Where's that tea...?

17:39.460 --> 17:40.960
Ouch...

17:40.960 --> 17:43.330
Oh, yer in trouble now...

17:43.330 --> 17:45.880
I hope ya said yer prayers, punk...

17:45.880 --> 17:48.290
Look, I get it, okay?! Here, drink some tea!

17:47.500 --> 17:49.920
<b>Green Tea</b>

17:48.290 --> 17:49.920
And put on some clothes while you're at it!

17:52.210 --> 17:53.540
Now die.

18:05.420 --> 18:07.790
H-how is she so fast?!

18:10.830 --> 18:13.000
O-oh shit! She's gonna kill me!

18:30.540 --> 18:32.630
GET BACK HERE, ASSHOLE!

18:32.630 --> 18:34.040
STOP CHASING ME!

18:34.290 --> 18:38.630
PUT ON SOME CLOTHES, YOU IDIOT!

18:41.210 --> 18:43.540
That lady's totally naked! She's silly!

18:43.540 --> 18:44.880
No, shield your eyes!

18:44.880 --> 18:46.420
Don't I know him from somewhere...?

18:46.420 --> 18:47.330
That's hilarious.

18:50.290 --> 18:52.500
What's all the fuss about...?

19:04.210 --> 19:07.080
Alcohol's gettin' to ya, ain't it?

19:07.080 --> 19:09.210
Can't move so well anymore, can ya?

19:09.210 --> 19:11.330
Don't go underestimatin' me...

19:11.330 --> 19:13.670
I toldja I'd turn you into mincemeat, didn't I?

19:13.670 --> 19:17.040
Fine... Then I ain't holdin' back anymore.

19:17.040 --> 19:19.880
The Great Hero's gonna show ya
what he's made of.

19:23.920 --> 19:27.880
TAKE THIS!

19:29.040 --> 19:31.580
Uh, ma'am?
Can we speak with you for a moment?

19:31.580 --> 19:32.710
Huh?

19:32.710 --> 19:35.420
We tend to discourage
running around town naked...

19:40.130 --> 19:43.080
Would you mind explaining
exactly what happened?

19:50.580 --> 19:53.290
I'm so sorry... Please forgive me...

19:53.290 --> 19:55.040
Jeez, what a mess...
I'm so sorry... Please forgive me...<b></b>

19:55.040 --> 19:57.540
How does someone end up naked
with brass knuckles...?

19:57.880 --> 19:59.750
Are you alright, sir?

19:59.750 --> 20:01.880
It looked like she was chasing after you...

20:01.880 --> 20:03.250
Y-yeah...

20:06.710 --> 20:10.670
Um... sorry, officers.
She's an acquaintance of mine.

20:10.670 --> 20:14.040
I gave her a drink and things got
completely out of hand.

20:14.040 --> 20:17.290
And the brass knuckles belong to me.
My bad...

20:20.750 --> 20:24.040
I really am sorry for all the trouble...

20:24.040 --> 20:25.540
Forget about it.

20:25.790 --> 20:30.250
Max... you put your life on the line
ten years ago.

20:30.250 --> 20:33.040
It's because of you that
our world still exists.

20:33.040 --> 20:34.790
And I'm grateful for that.

20:35.250 --> 20:37.250
So ya recognized me, eh?

20:37.250 --> 20:40.080
Sorry we had to meet like this...

20:44.080 --> 20:47.830
I sincerely apologize for
the events of last night!

20:47.830 --> 20:50.040
My secretary's actions were
completely unacceptable...

20:50.040 --> 20:51.750
Eh, it's whatever...

20:51.750 --> 20:54.000
So? Did she end up goin' home?

20:54.000 --> 20:56.250
Hm? Oh, about that-

20:57.040 --> 20:58.250
That must be her.

20:58.790 --> 21:00.210
What, a package?

21:00.210 --> 21:02.210
It's Zenia, your neighbor from unit 205.

21:03.460 --> 21:06.880
I just moved in next door,
so I came to say hello.

21:06.880 --> 21:09.040
I assume you've completed the paperwork?

21:09.040 --> 21:11.330
Yes, the apartment was move-in ready.

21:11.330 --> 21:14.210
Hey! What'd you just say?! You moved in?!

21:14.210 --> 21:15.830
NEXT DOOR?!

21:16.250 --> 21:19.750
Yes. Because regardless of what
happened yesterday,

21:19.750 --> 21:22.170
I'm still convinced that you're not
a trustworthy individual.

21:23.170 --> 21:26.170
I'd never forgive myself if something
happened to His Grace.

21:26.170 --> 21:28.580
So I intend to keep a close eye on him.

21:28.580 --> 21:31.500
Plus, it's a good opportunity to gather
intel on the Human Realm.

21:31.500 --> 21:33.250
Aren't yer priorities backwards?!

21:33.250 --> 21:34.380
Excellent!

21:34.380 --> 21:38.040
This apartment shall henceforth serve as
a foothold for the demon invasion!

21:40.250 --> 21:41.710
Gimme a frickin' break...

21:42.210 --> 21:44.460
I look forward to working with you, milord...

21:44.460 --> 21:46.210
...and you, Max...

22:02.460 --> 22:05.080
This woman... She's a demon?

22:06.580 --> 22:10.420
Hmm... Very interesting, Max...
